  "findings": [
    "One-output CPU median+2.3256%, two-output+7.2727%, vendor+8.75%, ten-two-slot+1.3158%. One has two slower CPU pairs and one tie; two is two slower/one faster. Vendor/ten-two-slot medians regress although two of their paired samples improve; do not suppress this within-batch variation.",
    "Bank CPU median-5.5556% has two faster/one slower pairs; waiting-4.7619% has two faster/one tie. Ten-eight-slot median-0.8850% still has two slower CPU pairs. Busy median ties with one faster/one tie/one slower. None establishes a robust general workflow/spike win.",
    "No-job all three CPU pairs tie. Mail-first CPU median+33.3333% is one15.625ms tick with two slower/one tie; its target copy branch is never reached. Retain it as whole-child/control variation, not evidence of a causal copy-branch penalty. Wall medians and raw pairs remain separate and unreconciled by averaging.",
    "GC-stopped transient-growth slopes are unchanged one-output45808B/refresh; two-output75432to73088(-2344B,-3.1074%); ten-output352456to330528(-21928B,-6.2215%); wide817848to773024(-44824B,-5.4807%). RawN4/N8 and intercepts, both trials, verified independently. These modest model savings do not establish retained-heap or GC-pause improvement.",
    "Final36e2 is bytecode-equivalent to b780 under same chunk name with debug data in51/54, so original32GC windows transfer without a repeated measurement. CPU uses the separately reviewed frozen31-file CWD route and final source."
  ],
  "scopeAndLimits": [
    "One fixed batch, three alternating pairs/profile, no retuning/resampling. Whole own-child user+kernel CPU includes interpreter/setup/source/20warmups/final facts/normalGC; monotonic wall is launch-through-communicate.15.625ms CPU quantum and broad within-batch variation limit precision.",
    "Actual modeled Followup/defaultList/Professions/Data/Craft code with controlled provider/native/count/bank/mail/UI endpoints, inherited fixed assertions/scalar counters, overwritten Paint sink. No native WoW CPU/FPS/frame-spike/prevalence/adoption or production acceptance.",
    "The32GC windows used5warmups and a stopped collector around only public Refresh work; they measure transient heap growth from two N points, not retained heap, peak allocation traffic or pause times. Internal scratch hashing/branches remain real candidate costs.",
    "Root owns final decision. Goal stays ACTIVE and production P57 remains unapplied. No tests, measurements, source/docs/native actions were executed by this review."
  ],
